  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## [3.1.2](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/compare/v3.1.1...v3.1.2) (2026-10-27)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* truncate nupkg release notes to 2048 characters ([ddd0e2b](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/ddd0e2b2f3bfd624e2f75e4911662244d8a246bb))\n\n## [3.1.1](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/compare/v3.1.0...v3.1.1) (2026-10-27)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **Common:** redirect xrandr's stdout/stderr streams; fix \"System.InvalidOperationException: StandardOut has not been redirected\" ([af6213d](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/af6213d33cde59a4dc3c41523d3ac7fd9ca561bd))\n* **Console:** limit error decorations length to terminal/console width ([6ceb6dc](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/6ceb6dc18be727e5a58f74dca4179d0d45f62475))\n* **Console:** write errors to StandardError; thread-sync console output so separate messages are not written simultaneously ([02b97c5](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/02b97c52cc90869ea3ec6686e7b933b9e2d3e4e5))\n* **deps:** upgrade Meziantou.Polyfill to v1.0.169 ([4e7efb0](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/4e7efb0009b06770598f62239b1080d12126dc4e))\n\n## [3.1.0](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/compare/v3.0.1...v3.1.0) (2026-10-24)\n\n### Features\n\n* **Common:** add extension method `System.Windows.Forms.Screen.DeviceFriendlyName()` ([1b3bd09](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/1b3bd094e9af435cf94a3d555b5dff3182a4844d))\n* **HCE:** add static class `ProfileInput.Presets`, class `ProfileInput.Presets.InputProfilePreset`, preset `SPV3Gamepad`, and method `ProfileInput.ApplyPreset(Presets.InputProfilePreset)` ([a1dad39](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/a1dad39ff0709a43fc1d835ebeee17aabcbccf9e))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **deps, Net:** force minimum HTTP version to HTTP 2 via `SocketsHttpHandler` (or `StandardSocketsHttpHandler` on .NET 4) ([c5464ba](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/c5464baeb6ec33e795e206b425e61644a8dc61eb))\n* **deps:** fix dependency graph issues linked to 385e4e9 ([fb625a4](https://github.com/HaloSPV3/HXE/commit/fb625a410b4773745f75f45c10f647a6c734ff90))\n\n(TRUNCATED)",
